function finishDialogueStep(ok,before,wasEvent,title,episode=''){if(!ok)return;if(wasEvent&&s.events?.pending?.instanceId!==wasEvent){const chain=data.presentation?.eventChain?.runId===s.id?data.presentation.eventChain:null;
 if(s.events?.pending?.followUp){data.presentation={...data.presentation,eventChain:chain||{runId:s.id,before,title,episode}};afterDialogue();return;}
 if(chain){before=chain.before;title=chain.title;episode=chain.episode||'';delete data.presentation.eventChain;}const names=['体力','やる気','トレーナーとのきずな'];const statLines=STAT_NAMES.map((name,i)=>[name,s.stats[i]-before.stats[i]]);const moodFrom=moodLevel(before.mood),moodTo=moodLevel(s.mood),basic=[['体力',s.energy-before.energy],['やる気',s.mood-before.mood,...(moodFrom!==moodTo?[MOOD_NAMES[moodFrom]+' → '+MOOD_NAMES[moodTo]]:[])],['トレーナーとのきずな',s.trainerBond-before.trainerBond]];const npcNames=Object.fromEntries([...NPCS,...TOWN_CAST,...ZODIAC_CAST].map(n=>[n.id,n.name]));const relations=[...new Set([...Object.keys(before.npcRelations),...Object.keys(s.npcRelations)])].map(id=>[(npcNames[id]||id)+'との友情',(s.npcRelations[id]||0)-(before.npcRelations[id]||0)]);const hints=[...new Set([...Object.keys(before.skillHints),...Object.keys(s.events?.skillHints||{})])].map(id=>['ひらめき '+id,(s.events?.skillHints?.[id]||0)-(before.skillHints[id]||0)]);const newTalents=(s.extraTalents||[]).filter(id=>!(before.talents||[]).includes(id));eventEffectResult={runId:s.id,title,...(episode?{episode}:{}),...(newTalents.length?{talents:newTalents}:{}),lines:[...statLines,...basic,...relations,...hints].filter(([,delta])=>delta!==0)};data.presentation={...data.presentation,eventReview:eventEffectResult};}afterDialogue();}
function showEventResult(){const item=eventEffectResult;if(!item)return;openModal('event-effects','会話のあとで',`<div class="event-effect-summary">${item.episode?`<p class="event-effect-episode">${esc(item.episode)}</p>`:''}<h3>${esc(item.title)}</h3>${(item.talents||[]).map(id=>TALENTS[id]).filter(Boolean).map(t=>`<div class="talent-get${t.gold?' gold':''}"><small>${t.gold?'★ 金の才能を手に入れた！':'才能を手に入れた！'}</small><b>${esc(t.name)}</b><span>${esc(t.description)}</span></div>`).join('')}${item.lines.length?`<p>今回の会話で変わったこと</p>${item.lines.map(([name,delta,words])=>`<div class="event-effect-line"><span>${esc(name)}</span><strong class="${delta>0?'positive':'negative'}">${words?esc(words):(delta>0?'＋':'−')+Math.abs(delta)}</strong></div>`).join('')}`:item.talents?.length?'':'<p>今回の会話で変わったこと</p><p class="no-effect">ステータスの変化はありません。</p>'}</div>${button('event-effects-done',hasPendingDialogue(s)?'確認して、次の会話へ →':'確認してつづける →','primary full')}`,false);}
